<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia's SFE wheat futures higher, more active.</title>
<headline>Australia's SFE wheat futures higher, more active.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Traded Sydney Futures Exchange (SFE) wheat futures moved higher on Thursday with the November contract jumping A$6.50 to A$177.00 a tonne on a volume of two lots while the more active January 1998 contract rose A$4.50 to A$174 on a volume of 15 lots.</p>
<p>Settlement prices for the untraded contracts were higher.</p>
